 "descripcion": "From a rope over a pole to a real tower crane: why more pulleys mean less force, why the concrete blocks at the back keep it standing, and how the crane makes itself taller.\n\nWhat should we build next?\n\n#engineering #towercrane #construction #howitworks #shorts",
