 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "Your new building needs steel beams lifted to the top.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  },
  {
   "texto": "So you hang a pulley from a pole and pull. Problem solved!",
   "pausa": 0.3
  },
  {
   "texto": "But a steel beam weighs over a ton. Nobody can pull that.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  },
  {
   "texto": "So you add more pulleys. Four ropes share the load, so you pull a quarter.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  },
  {
   "texto": "But a pole only lifts straight up, and the beam needs to go sideways.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  },
  {
   "texto": "So you build a steel tower with a long arm, and a trolley rolls the beam over.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  },
  {
   "texto": "But hang a heavy load at the tip, and the crane tips over.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  },
  {
   "texto": "So you stack concrete blocks on a short back arm. Now it balances.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  },
  {
   "texto": "But the building keeps growing, until it's taller than the crane.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  },
  {
   "texto": "So the crane jacks up its own top and slides in a new tower piece. It builds itself!",
   "pausa": 0.3
  },
  {
   "texto": "Congratulations! You just built a tower crane. What should we build next?",
   "pausa": 0.2
  }
 ],
